#: kstars.kcfg:860 xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:495
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify the text of the first line of the label. By default, it says "
"something like \"Looking at Earth\".  Any instances of %t will be replaced "
"by the target name, and any instances of %o will be replaced by the origin "
"name."
msgstr ""
"Den Text för de eerste Reeg vun't Textfeld angeven. Standardwies is dat "
"jichtenswat liek \"Looking at Earth\". För elk %t warrt de Teelnaam, un för "
"elk %o Herkomstnaam insett."

