msgid "Date format"
msgstr "Formaat vun't Datum"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (XplanetDateFormat), group (Xplanet)
#. +> trunk stable
#: kstars.kcfg:875
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify the format for the date/time label.  This format string is passed to "
"strftime(3).  The default is \"%c %Z\", which shows the date, time, and time "
"zone in the locale’s appropriate date and time representation."
msgstr ""
"Dat Datum- un Tietformaat för dat Textfeld fastleggen. Disse Formaat-"
"Tekenkeed warrt na strftime(3) övergeven. Standard is \"%c %Z\". Dit wiest "
"dat Datum, de Tiet un dat Tietrebeet in't lokaal Datum- un Tietformaat."

