#. +> trunk stable
#: kstars.kcfg:936
msgid ""
"Use a file as the background image, with the planet to be superimposed upon "
"it. This option is only meaningful with the -projection option. A color may "
"also be supplied."
msgstr ""
"En Datei as Achtergrundbild bruken, op de de Planet vörblendt warrt. Disse "
"Instellen is bloots mit de Optschoon \"Projizeren\" sinnvull. Een kann man "
"ok en Klöör as Achtergrund nehmen."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetBackgroundImage), group (Xplanet)
#. +> trunk stable
#: kstars.kcfg:940
msgid "Use background image"
msgstr "Achtergrundbild bruken"

